{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_angel_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_angel_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "來信",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_angel_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "73dfa64c5e6f7a8496f6f7bb0ac216544587879518d61203e22c4371530dfb4d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "个人剧情 能天使"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "砰砰砰！\n啪啪！砰！\n噠噠噠噠！砰啪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咻咻咻！砰砰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後一個人，最後一顆橡皮彈，無污染無浪費，絕對節能環保，你覺得怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "追了我三條街，你們還真執著欸，都說東西不在我身上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地痞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "混蛋，什麼環保，你是在耍我嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "被你發現啦？沒辦法，因為要解決掉你們真的簡單到無聊嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，遊戲結束。這位先生，如果還有什麼想說的，建議你趁現在抓緊時間說哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地痞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別過來，你別過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "3、2、1，時間到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啪！你死啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地痞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——全中！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不愧是我，準頭真好。嗯，獎勵自己今天可以多吃一塊蘋果派！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來......工作工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，今天最後一個地址，中街12-7號，阿徐飯館......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哇哦，抱歉，有沒有撞到你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿徐飯館的話就在那邊哦，方向反了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，真的......謝謝你啊，小哥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不客氣。難得看到同鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拉特蘭人？看起來是信使啊......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（信......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......安魂夜前寫封信回家好像也不錯。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "基地應該有信紙吧，嗯......也買點特產一起送回去好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先工作，先工作，阿徐飯館......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有了，就是這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打擾了，有人在嗎？企鵝物流送貨上門——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰啊......哇啊！這是怎麼回事，地上這是......死、死人了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，沒什麼，別在意這種小事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "企鵝物流加急特送，街區重建出血特惠服務，現在起三天內配送費減半哦！這些都是您訂購的貨物沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......快遞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下，這應該是送錯了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是訂了東西，可這才剛下單沒幾個小時，應該沒可能送到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這話就不對了，下單都幾個小時了，物品送達也很正常吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "速度可是物流業的生命耶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "擴音器材、彩燈、還有花籃。哇哦，是新店開張用的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恭喜恭喜。東西都在這兒了，怎麼樣，沒錯吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實，這些和我的訂單內容一模一樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道真的是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會有錯的，同城速遞完全是小菜一碟，要不是路上收拾了點煩人的傢伙，本來還能更快一點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，沒什麼沒什麼，別在意！沒問題的話麻煩簽收！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，哦，哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，委託完成！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拜拜啦，記得給好評哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，等下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地痞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，真是，現在的小姑娘真讓人搞不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "一般龍門市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好歹把自己帶來的這些“垃圾”收拾掉再走啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，最後一單，完成！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣一來今天的工作就都結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——德克薩斯、可頌，你們那裡結束沒？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題，東西都送到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這邊老闆要的東西也到手了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上門來搶的人還不少，不過我都解決了，就這麼個盒子，也不知道是什麼東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞不好是什麼危險物品哦。不過，不管是什麼，我們只要把來找麻煩的人都解決掉就行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！收工了收工了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "地痞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_002",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "站......住......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能天使，這一片是你負責的吧，這傢伙居然還有力氣開口說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "市區內不許用實彈嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些傢伙看起來也不像是那幾夥黑幫的人......我要是不守規矩，萬一被逮到會很麻煩耶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且這次我們是來幫忙重建街區的，還被叮囑了別惹事，我可是特地避開了要害哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "留一口氣，這裡的居民自己也能搞定。應該沒問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上回能天使姐用實彈，還是接羅德島的外派那次吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那次可真熱鬧，我看老闆對羅德島態度還不錯，好像是打算長期合作來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "差不多吧，那群人還挺有意思的，老闆會中意也不奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠會鬧事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，這不就是老闆最喜歡的嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，外派聽起來怪麻煩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多跑跑而已嘛，和我們之前幹的活也差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊給的薪水還有加班費補貼很不錯哦，再加上老闆這裡的薪資，等於是有雙份薪水可以領！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的假的，雙份？！那再加上這次的外快，這個月豈不是能賺到這個數字？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也去！能天使姐，下次帶我一起去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，就知道你會這麼說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊糟糕，怎麼都這個時間了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快快，德克薩斯，把速度提滿，我們得趕快趕回基地，不然就來不及了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上車，坐穩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等下等下！好，我抓穩了，你踩油門吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹嘛那麼著急......哎，德克薩斯姐，你都不問問是什麼事這麼急？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正肯定不是什麼正經事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別當面說我壞話啊，明明很正經的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再不趕回去，我放在烤箱裡的蘋果派就要烤焦了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這哪正經了！啊，啊啊啊，德克薩斯姐你別突然加速轉彎啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_pgbase_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太慢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比我聽完三整張黑膠還慢，你們是腿腳鈍了還是老眼昏花，送點東西要花這麼多時間？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，太好了，我的蘋果派沒事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯，香氣不錯，火候正好，完美！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！聽我說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆啊，我們可是一路飆車回來的欸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多虧一路上沒碰到交警，要不然過會兒罰單就該被送到基地門口了，那估計德克薩斯姐這個月的薪水都完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是說啊！德克薩斯可是冒著被扣光薪水的風險趕著回來，老闆別怪她啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克薩斯，說說感想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要借你點趁手的傢伙收拾這兩個混蛋嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（歎氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，沒意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "寬宏大量的我就不計較你們的磨磨蹭蹭和慢手慢腳，我要的東西呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，就是這個！阿能，把我的專用座椅搬來，還有最新的那台電子護目鏡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來了老闆！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次又是什麼？嗯......這個盒子還挺重的，是什麼機械？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！這個側面的商標，還有這個造型的手柄，我有印象！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道這個就是在市面上已經完全絕跡的......上上世代的電子遊戲機？我記得曾經還有闊佬出大價錢收購來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，遊戲。誰說生活不是一場遊戲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克薩斯，把線接上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這根線？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，有畫面了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，嗯？看起來像是個橫版的賽車遊戲......方向鍵，快速鍵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後這個按鍵，嗯？這個是炸彈的意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起炸彈，這個看起來更像是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石爆破物發射器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，這不是那種要躲避障礙物到達終點的賽車遊戲嗎，為什麼會有源石爆破物發射器這種東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "笨蛋！誰說一定要閃閃躲躲才能到終點？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "懂了，就這麼一直線衝過去，把擋路的傢伙都轟飛就行了！這遊戲不錯嘛，規則簡單好懂，我喜歡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "操作看起來沒問題，啊，好像還可以雙人一起玩欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老闆，怎麼樣，要不要來一局試試？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "邀請我參加遊戲？註定會勝利的遊戲有什麼樂趣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "德克薩斯，你上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（歎氣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_pgbase_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，彈藥補充完畢，看我這招！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然把前面的建築物都炸了，真不愧是你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈！炸一兩棟樓而已，小意思，這局我贏定了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——有破綻！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（朝對面車道發射爆破彈）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "居然還能攻擊對手的賽道？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒說不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實沒說！既然你用這招，那就別怪我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種東西就是該以眼還眼，有來有還嘛！別想躲開，我炸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇哇哇怎麼連直接攻擊其他玩家都可以啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒說不行不是嗎？嘿嘿，乘勝追擊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？好像有人來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下午好，大家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這是在玩什麼？從外面就能聽到喊聲，嚇了我一跳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，是空啊！來來，坐這邊，能天使姐和德克薩斯姐打遊戲呢，老闆弄回來的古董遊戲機，讓我們先玩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要一起嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊戲？我就算了，這種我不怎麼擅長......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，對了，門口信箱裡的信我順帶拿進來了。這個月的帳單又是一大疊，這樣下去真的沒問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有......給，這封的收件人是能天使。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給我的信？是帳單，還是挑戰書？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，總不會是學校給我補發的畢業證吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啥，原來能天使姐沒拿到畢業證啊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然拿到了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，上次和黑幫打架的時候，一不小心混在老闆提供的假鈔和假文憑裡一起燒了而已。嘿嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我提醒過你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？抱歉，我完全不記得了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽起來就像是你會做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過這個看起來好像只是普通的私人信件，應該不是能天使你說的那些吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這可不好說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎可頌，手柄給你，替我玩一會兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我看看啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咦，是老姐寄來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼說來，白天的確是遇到了拉特蘭來的信使來著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚哇，居然寫了這麼厚一疊，老姐是有多不放心我啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能天使你的姐姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下，等等，我怎麼記得你姐姐是出了事故......因此能天使你才追到龍門來找莫斯提馬......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？是這樣沒錯啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我姐姐確實是幾年前任務出了點事故，在醫院昏迷了好長一段時間......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，在我離開拉特蘭之前，她就已經清醒過來啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？怎麼了，空，怎麼一副看到老闆在演唱會上一邊跳舞一邊唱抒情歌曲一樣的表情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你舉的那是什麼例子，也太可怕了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......沒什麼，別理我。只是覺得還真心擔心過你的自己太傻了而已......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，讓我猜猜......你該不會之前誤會了什麼吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，真的？不會吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然老姐她當時確實傷得很重，但現在已經在逐漸恢復了啦。不然，我怎麼可能丟下她跑出來嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......這麼一想倒也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......不過也不怪你誤會，畢竟那次真的很危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我自己也從來沒想過老姐會受那麼重的傷，還滿身是血昏迷不醒地被抱回來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滿身是血？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的，比我們平時鬧的動靜都誇張多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得自己的膽子算大了，但當時還是被嚇到流冷汗，現在想起來手都會變涼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不開玩笑，在還沒搞清楚情況的時候，我差點就跳出去和把姐姐帶回來的那傢伙打架呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完全能想像到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過你說的那個人，該不會就是......莫斯提馬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，就是那傢伙。在把姐姐送回來之後，她立刻就不知道消失到哪去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等之後老姐恢復意識，也完全不告訴我當時到底發生了什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣不清不楚的，讓我怎麼可能甘心嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以囉，就是因為想問清楚當時到底發生了什麼，我才會追著莫斯提馬一路從拉特蘭跑到龍門，然後才遇到老闆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，那個，怎麼說呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為你的那個加入理由，再加上每次提到莫斯提馬，能天使你都欲言又止的，我本來還以為你們是有什麼深仇大恨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果說莫斯提馬總是周末拉著我姐加班，害我被爽約好多次也算有仇的話，那倒確實可以說是仇怨很深。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們是小學生嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......不行，完全想不出能天使的姐姐會是什麼樣的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要一想到像能天使你這樣的人居然可能會有兩個，我就頭疼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那你可猜錯了，我和老姐好像還真不怎麼像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。因為我們沒血緣關係嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣的嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊......等等，可頌你怎麼也在聽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為很少聽能天使姐提自己的事啊，忍不住就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸很少嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，等等先別說了，快專心看螢幕，別分心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——太遲了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我贏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊德克薩斯姐！居然趁機超車太卑鄙了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......完全輸掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（大家好奇心還真重。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不過，原來我沒提過姐姐的事情嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（好像也不奇怪，因為也沒有人問過嘛......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（說起來莫斯提馬那傢伙，等了這麼久也完全沒出現，老闆該不會是誆我的吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（......算了，就順其自然吧！總之先寫回信......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，不知道有沒有什麼能長期存放，不怕顛簸的點心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，能天使，你去哪裡，不玩了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，你們先玩，我出門買點特產，很快就回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上回來再來一局吧，德克薩斯！剛剛那局不算數，我們重新比一場！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，等著吧，這次我一定會贏的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
